{"title": "Lunar Bulwark", "pageid": 41064, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Lunar_Bulwark", "categories": ["Spells that last until long rest", "Spells", "Level 1 Spells", "Abjuration spells", "Actions", "Bugs"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Mage_Armour.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/51/Mage_Armour.webp/300px-Mage_Armour.webp, /w/images/5/51/Mage_Armour.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/51/Mage_Armour.webp/300px-Mage_Armour.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/51/Mage_Armour.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Lunar Bulwark </b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">level 1 abjuration spell</a>. It is granted by the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Moon_Devotion_Robe\" title=\"Moon Devotion Robe\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Moon_Devotion_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Moon_Devotion_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Moon_Devotion_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Moon_Devotion_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Moon_Devotion_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Moon_Devotion_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Moon_Devotion_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Moon_Devotion_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a1/Moon_Devotion_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Moon_Devotion_Robe\" title=\"Moon Devotion Robe\">Moon Devotion Robe</a>, which allows the wearer cast the functional equivalent of <a href=\"/wiki/Mage_Armour\" title=\"Mage Armour\">Mage Armour</a> on themselves once per long rest.<sup><i>[<a class=\"mw-selflink-fragment\" href=\"#Bugs\">See: Bugs</a>]</i></sup>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Bathe yourself in the shielding magic of <a href=\"/wiki/Sel%C3%BBne\" title=\"Selûne\">Selûne's</a> watchful gaze. \n</p>\n<span style=\"color: white;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/25px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/38px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Prerequisite Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/25px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><span class=\"bg3wiki-prereq\">The target can't be wearing <a href=\"/wiki/Armour\" title=\"Armour\">Armour</a>.</span></span><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: Self\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: Self</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Long rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a></dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"At_higher_levels\"> At higher levels </span></h2>\n<p>Casting this spell at a higher level grants no additional benefit. </p>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Shout_MAG_Selunite_MageArmor</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_MAG_Selunite_MageArmor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_MAG_Selunite_MageArmor\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/wiki/HasSomaticComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasSomaticComponent (spell flag)\">HasSomaticComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/HasVerbalComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasVerbalComponent (spell flag)\">HasVerbalComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsSpell_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsSpell (spell flag)\">IsSpell</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Mage_Armour\"> Condition: Mage Armour </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mage_Armour_(Condition)\" title=\"Mage Armour (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Mage_Armour_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Mage_Armour_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Mage_Armour_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Mage_Armour_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Mage_Armour_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Mage_Armour_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mage Armour\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Mage_Armour_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Mage_Armour_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/05/Mage_Armour_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mage_Armour_(Condition)\" title=\"Mage Armour (Condition)\">Mage Armour</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: Until <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a></p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Base <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/38px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Armour Class\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\">Armour Class</a> is 13.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by items:\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Moon_Devotion_Robe\" title=\"Moon Devotion Robe\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Moon_Devotion_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Moon_Devotion_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Moon_Devotion_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Moon_Devotion_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Moon_Devotion_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Moon_Devotion_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Moon_Devotion_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Moon_Devotion_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a1/Moon_Devotion_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Moon_Devotion_Robe\" title=\"Moon Devotion Robe\">Moon Devotion Robe</a></span> </li>\n</ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The normal base <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/38px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Armour Class\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\">Armour Class</a> is 10 + <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity modifier</a>, while this spell changes it to 13 + Dexterity Modifier.\n<ul><li>The recipient still gets bonuses from other sources that do not change their base armour class such as +1 AC <a href=\"/wiki/Robes\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Robes\">robes</a>, <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bracers_of_Defence\" title=\"Bracers of Defence\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a2/Bracers_of_Defence_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Bracers_of_Defence_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a2/Bracers_of_Defence_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Bracers_of_Defence_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a2/Bracers_of_Defence_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Bracers_of_Defence_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a2/Bracers_of_Defence_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Bracers_of_Defence_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a2/Bracers_of_Defence_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bracers_of_Defence\" title=\"Bracers of Defence\">Bracers of Defence</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shield_of_Faith_(Condition)\" title=\"Shield of Faith (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Shield_of_Faith_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Shield_of_Faith_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/98/Shield_of_Faith_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Shield_of_Faith_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/98/Shield_of_Faith_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Shield_of_Faith_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shield of Faith\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Shield_of_Faith_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Shield_of_Faith_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/98/Shield_of_Faith_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shield_of_Faith_(Condition)\" title=\"Shield of Faith (Condition)\">Shield of Faith</a>, etc.</li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Gloves\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gloves\">Gloves</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Helmets\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Helmets\">Helmets</a> marked as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Light_Armour\" title=\"Light Armour\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/17/Light_Armour_Icon.png/20px-Light_Armour_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/17/Light_Armour_Icon.png/30px-Light_Armour_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/17/Light_Armour_Icon.png/40px-Light_Armour_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Light\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/17/Light_Armour_Icon.png/20px-Light_Armour_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/17/Light_Armour_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Light_Armour\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Light Armour\">Light</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Medium_Armour\" title=\"Medium Armour\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/73/Medium_Armour_Icon.png/20px-Medium_Armour_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/73/Medium_Armour_Icon.png/30px-Medium_Armour_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/73/Medium_Armour_Icon.png/40px-Medium_Armour_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Medium\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/73/Medium_Armour_Icon.png/20px-Medium_Armour_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/73/Medium_Armour_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Medium_Armour\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Medium Armour\">Medium</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Heavy_Armour\" title=\"Heavy Armour\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Heavy_Armour_Icon.png/20px-Heavy_Armour_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Heavy_Armour_Icon.png/30px-Heavy_Armour_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Heavy_Armour_Icon.png/40px-Heavy_Armour_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Heavy Armour\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Heavy_Armour_Icon.png/20px-Heavy_Armour_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b7/Heavy_Armour_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Heavy_Armour\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Heavy Armour\">Heavy Armour</a> count as armour, and will prevent Mage Armour from working.</li>\n<li>Mage Armour works while wearing a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shields\" title=\"Shields\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Shields_Icon.png/20px-Shields_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Shields_Icon.png/30px-Shields_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Shields_Icon.png/40px-Shields_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shield\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Shields_Icon.png/20px-Shields_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/af/Shields_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shields\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Shields\">Shield</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mage_Armour_(Condition)\" title=\"Mage Armour (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Mage_Armour_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Mage_Armour_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Mage_Armour_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Mage_Armour_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Mage_Armour_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Mage_Armour_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mage Armour\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Mage_Armour_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Mage_Armour_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/05/Mage_Armour_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mage_Armour_(Condition)\" title=\"Mage Armour (Condition)\">Mage Armour</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Draconic_Resilience\" title=\"Draconic Resilience\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Draconic_Resilience_Icon.webp/20px-Draconic_Resilience_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Draconic_Resilience_Icon.webp/30px-Draconic_Resilience_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Draconic_Resilience_Icon.webp/40px-Draconic_Resilience_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Draconic Resilience\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Draconic_Resilience_Icon.webp/20px-Draconic_Resilience_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3d/Draconic_Resilience_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Draconic_Resilience\" title=\"Draconic Resilience\">Draconic Resilience</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Unarmoured_Defence_(Barbarian)\" title=\"Unarmoured Defence (Barbarian)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/27/Unarmoured_Defence_Barbarian_Icon.webp/20px-Unarmoured_Defence_Barbarian_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/27/Unarmoured_Defence_Barbarian_Icon.webp/30px-Unarmoured_Defence_Barbarian_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/27/Unarmoured_Defence_Barbarian_Icon.webp/40px-Unarmoured_Defence_Barbarian_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Unarmoured Defence (Barbarian)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/27/Unarmoured_Defence_Barbarian_Icon.webp/20px-Unarmoured_Defence_Barbarian_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/27/Unarmoured_Defence_Barbarian_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Unarmoured_Defence_(Barbarian)\" title=\"Unarmoured Defence (Barbarian)\">Unarmoured Defence (Barbarian)</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Unarmoured_Defence_(Monk)\" title=\"Unarmoured Defence (Monk)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7c/Unarmoured_Defence_Monk_Icon.webp/20px-Unarmoured_Defence_Monk_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7c/Unarmoured_Defence_Monk_Icon.webp/30px-Unarmoured_Defence_Monk_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7c/Unarmoured_Defence_Monk_Icon.webp/40px-Unarmoured_Defence_Monk_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Unarmoured Defence (Monk)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7c/Unarmoured_Defence_Monk_Icon.webp/20px-Unarmoured_Defence_Monk_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7c/Unarmoured_Defence_Monk_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Unarmoured_Defence_(Monk)\" title=\"Unarmoured Defence (Monk)\">Unarmoured Defence (Monk)</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Barkskin_(Condition)\" title=\"Barkskin (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/00/Barkskin_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Barkskin_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/00/Barkskin_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Barkskin_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/00/Barkskin_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Barkskin_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Barkskin\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/00/Barkskin_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Barkskin_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/00/Barkskin_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Barkskin_(Condition)\" title=\"Barkskin (Condition)\">Barkskin</a> all change one's base armour class and therefore do not stack.\n<ul><li>If one has multiple of these they will only get the benefit of the one which gives the most <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/38px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Armour Class\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\">Armour Class</a>.</li></ul></li>\n<li>Mage Armour can work while in <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Shape\" title=\"Wild Shape\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Wild_Shape_Icon.webp/20px-Wild_Shape_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Wild_Shape_Icon.webp/30px-Wild_Shape_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Wild_Shape_Icon.webp/40px-Wild_Shape_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wild Shape\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Wild_Shape_Icon.webp/20px-Wild_Shape_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Wild_Shape_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Shape\" title=\"Wild Shape\">Wild Shape</a> as long as one has no armour equipped in any slot before transforming.\n<ul><li>This effect only functions on forms with a base <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/38px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Armour Class\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\">Armour Class</a> lower than 13.</li></ul></li>\n<li>Mage Armour does not count as wearing armour for things like <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Unarmoured_Movement\" title=\"Unarmoured Movement\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/Unarmoured_Movement_Icon.webp/20px-Unarmoured_Movement_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/62/Unarmoured_Movement_Icon.webp/30px-Unarmoured_Movement_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/62/Unarmoured_Movement_Icon.webp/40px-Unarmoured_Movement_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Unarmoured Movement\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/Unarmoured_Movement_Icon.webp/20px-Unarmoured_Movement_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/62/Unarmoured_Movement_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Unarmoured_Movement\" title=\"Unarmoured Movement\">Unarmoured Movement</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Become_the_Bulwark\" title=\"Become the Bulwark\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a2/Bracers_of_Defence_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Bracers_of_Defence_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a2/Bracers_of_Defence_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Bracers_of_Defence_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a2/Bracers_of_Defence_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Bracers_of_Defence_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Become the Bulwark\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a2/Bracers_of_Defence_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Bracers_of_Defence_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a2/Bracers_of_Defence_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Become_the_Bulwark\" title=\"Become the Bulwark\">Become the Bulwark</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Defence\" title=\"Defence\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e2/Defence_Icon.webp/20px-Defence_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e2/Defence_Icon.webp/30px-Defence_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e2/Defence_Icon.webp/40px-Defence_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Defence\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e2/Defence_Icon.webp/20px-Defence_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e2/Defence_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Defence\" title=\"Defence\">Defence</a>.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>The incantation for Mage Armour is <b>Mactē Virtutē</b>, the Latin command \"honour with virtue!\"</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Although <a href=\"/wiki/Sel%C3%BBne%27s_Protection\" title=\"Selûne's Protection\">Selûne's Protection</a> associated with the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Moon_Devotion_Robe\" title=\"Moon Devotion Robe\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Moon_Devotion_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Moon_Devotion_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Moon_Devotion_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Moon_Devotion_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Moon_Devotion_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Moon_Devotion_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Moon_Devotion_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Moon_Devotion_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a1/Moon_Devotion_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Moon_Devotion_Robe\" title=\"Moon Devotion Robe\">Moon Devotion Robe</a> should be activated by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lunar_Bulwark\" title=\"Lunar Bulwark\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Mage_Armour_Icon.webp/20px-Mage_Armour_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/Mage_Armour_Icon.webp/30px-Mage_Armour_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/Mage_Armour_Icon.webp/40px-Mage_Armour_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lunar Bulwark\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Mage_Armour_Icon.webp/20px-Mage_Armour_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0d/Mage_Armour_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Lunar Bulwark</a>, it is not; the wearer must instead have the regular version of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mage_Armour\" title=\"Mage Armour\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Mage_Armour_Icon.webp/20px-Mage_Armour_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/Mage_Armour_Icon.webp/30px-Mage_Armour_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/Mage_Armour_Icon.webp/40px-Mage_Armour_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mage Armour\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Mage_Armour_Icon.webp/20px-Mage_Armour_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0d/Mage_Armour_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mage_Armour\" title=\"Mage Armour\">Mage Armour</a> cast on them for its radiant damage to function.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715034314\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.154 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.166 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 7905/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 86329/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 37900/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 35/1000\nLua time usage: 0.078/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1753268/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  138.065      1 Template:Feature_page\n100.00%  138.065      1 -total\n 77.43%  106.907     89 Template:Trim\n 22.88%   31.585     20 Template:Icon_text\n 21.84%   30.153     18 Template:Icon_link\n 18.36%   25.351      3 Template:SmRarityItem\n 18.05%   24.922     12 Template:SmSAI\n 15.87%   21.912      4 Template:Item_icon\n 10.71%   14.791      3 Template:SmCond\n  9.23%   12.745     2